gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Hi! Sorry to keep you waiting!\p"
	.string "Welcome to the world of POKéMON!\p"
	.string "My name is BIRCH. People call me\n"
	.string "the POKéMON PROFESSOR.\p"
	.string "But I'd rather be outside, finding\n"
	.string "lands nobody has mapped yet!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "And every land is full of POKéMON.\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "Each land has 8 GYM BADGES to win,\n"
	.string "then VICTORY ROAD, the ELITE FOUR\l"
	.string "and its CHAMPION.\p"
	.string "Out there, you may catch only the\n"
	.string "first POKéMON you meet in each area.\p"
	.string "A POKéMON that faints is gone\n"
	.string "for good. So take care of them!\p"
	.string "If your whole team faints, your\n"
	.string "journey there ends.\p"
	.string "But what you earn stays with you,\n"
	.string "and I'll always find a new land.\p"
	.string "Every land has its own name. Tell\n"
	.string "a friend, and they can visit it!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And who might you be?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy?\n"
	.string "Or are you a girl?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "All right.\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}! Good to meet you.\p"
	.string "I've just found a new land. Here,\n"
	.string "take a look at my map!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "Off to {STR_VAR_1}, then!\p"
	.string "Meet me in my lab there. Your\n"
	.string "first partner is waiting!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_WelcomeBack::
	.string "Welcome back, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "I've found another land for you.$"
